# Zilortha's LethalDamageByPower$ (StaticAbilityContinuous.java:927-929,
# Card.getLethal): lethal damage to creatures its controller controls is
# their power. Horned Turtle (1/4) attacks, Grizzly Bears blocks and deals
# 2, at least the Turtle's power of 1, so CR 704.5g destroys it; the Bears
# take 1 and live.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 2
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 3=2
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
advance
